# Where `npm run dev` proxies /api.
#
# Defaults to the deployed API so the operator UI can be worked on without
# running a server locally. Point it at http://localhost:8000 instead when you
# are also changing server code (cd ../server && npm run dev).
#
# NOTE: this is the production database either way — server/.env points at the
# live Hostinger host, so there is no separate dev data. Edits here are real.
VITE_API_PROXY=https://campus-connect-api-o0xt.onrender.com
